      "expression": "S = int d^4x sqrt(-g) [ F(phi)(R-2Lambda)/(2kappa) - epsilon(k(grad phi)^2/2 + U(phi)) - Z(grad chi_A)^2/2 - W(|chi|^2) + epsilon h delta |chi|^2/2 ], F = 1 + epsilon xi delta^2, U = rho_star + mu2 delta^2/2 + lambda_phi delta^4/4, W = m2|chi|^2/2 + lambda_chi|chi|^4/4, delta = phi - phi_star",
